2. Big-picture flow of the GUI app

User’s experience:
	1.	Open app.
	2.	Click “Load CSV”.
	3.	See some confirmation like “Loaded 8 calibration points, 3 unknowns”.
	4.	Click “Fit curve + calculate unknowns”.
	5.	See:
	•	Fitted 4PL parameters shown somewhere in the window.
	•	Table/list of unknowns with estimated concentrations.
	6.	Click “Plot” (or it happens automatically after fitting):
	•	Window/area shows:
	•	Calibration points (scatter)
	•	Smooth 4PL curve
	•	Unknowns as separate markers on the curve (using their estimated concentration & measured signal).

That’s the full story.

